      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brookfield%2C_New_Hampshire"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The James Hackett Farmstead, now a 244.5‑acre preserve, preserves Revolutionary‑era stone walls and offers a glimpse into early New Hampshire farming.",
